# Frontend UI kit

Source of truth: `docs/architecture/design-system.md` (ADR-030).

## Ownership

`packages/frontend/ui-kit` (`@b2b-saas-starter-kit/ui-kit`): presentation only.

- No RTK Query, no business logic, no `contracts` for behavior
- Foundation export: native HTML `Button` (`<button type="button">`)
- **No** Tailwind, Radix, shadcn, design tokens, or `ThemeProvider` until a later ADR

```tsx
import {Button} from '@b2b-saas-starter-kit/ui-kit'

<Button disabled={!canInvite} onClick={invite}>
  Invite member
</Button>
```

## Forbidden

- Do not add a CSS framework or theme wrapper as a placeholder
- Do not put data-fetching in this package
